## Stretch Ontology Generate card to the shell bottom

Context: Ontology → Import already fills the remaining height below the
section header through the shared `.content-section > .card` flex chain.
Ontology → Generate nested its main card inside a stage pane (below the
stepper), so the card stopped at content height and left empty canvas
below. The configure pane now continues that flex chain down to the
sidebar bottom, matching Import.

Changes:

1. src/front/static/ontology/css/ontology-wizard.css
   Stretch wizard stage panes; fill the Configure card and tab wrap to the
   remaining height; keep Review/Complete scrollable; reset the chain on
   mobile.
2. tests/units/front/test_sidebar_content_stretch_contract.py
   Lock the Generate configure-pane flex chain in the shared stretch
   contract.

